0&blur=200&s=8a081608f998f308a92ace52c2a49453", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/93b3ac68/uploads/origins/9c41b433-3488-4821-b06a-98e1eb296ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8a081608f998f308a92ace52c2a49453, https://si.imgix.net/93b3ac68/uploads/origins/9c41b433-3488-4821-b06a-98e1eb296ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d2421cd253cc38e4954e5d1ef3100245 2x, https://si.imgix.net/93b3ac68/uploads/origins/9c41b433-3488-4821-b06a-98e1eb296ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fe3d1df42fe32390884126a574cedf3c 3x"}, "body": "Your illustrations are beautiful! I would be happy if you can accept my request.\n\nCharacter A. 170cm. 14 years old. A hunter. Good at archery. Thick eyebrows. Please pay attention to his skin tone. There is no need to draw his hat. Although he grew up to become a serious adult, he was brash and self-assured when he was younger.\n\nCharacter B. 170cm. A person with cat ears. Long eyelashes. No tail. A gentle person. Likes to smile. Wears the dress from the image B04. Please make sure the hair is at shoulder level.\n\nChara A and Chara B consider each other as family. \nThe both if them live in a surreal fantasy world.\nIf they go out of the village, monsters attack!\n\nChara A chasing a sheep. The sheep looks like the blocky sheep in minecraft. \nMeanwhile, Chara B is chasing Chara A with a worried expression. She has been doing laundry.\n\nFor the rest of the details, I will leave it to you. If there are problems with the request with the amount, please resend:\n\nReference:\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/x81iueh2pjrh2brtef4bq/AGne2evtJbeN3-CP-0BKbVU?rlkey=rv0wrkpks71gf1edwi9wxdup3&e=1&dl=0", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@jo_oekaki_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tip