t one from you.\n\n[Request Details]\n・An illustration of a boy (around high school age) who is feeling a bit dazed from a fever.\n\nI’d love it if he were the cute type and wearing a school uniform. Other than that, I’ll leave everything up to you.\n\nI plan to use this for my personal enjoyment as well as for my Twitter profile picture.\nIf the details don’t suit you, please feel free to cancel the request.\n\nI apologize for bothering you during such a busy time, but I would appreciate it if you could consider this request.", "nc": 25, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@jo_oekaki_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2168867, "client_id": 3974970, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d35fe725/uploads/origins/4ac48351-f7ba-4f9d-9dc3-32df27c55a3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36b22d98c94cd893ce7298f5a1f8e16b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d35fe725/uploads/origins/4ac48351-f7ba-4f9d-9dc3-32df27c55a3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36b22d98c94cd893ce7298f5a1f8e16b, https://si.imgix.net/d35fe725/uploads/origins/4ac48351-f7ba-4f9d-9dc3-32df27c55a3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abba2cf0562510b22048906484425282 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d35fe725/uploads/origins/4ac48351-f7ba-4f9d-9dc3-32df27c55a3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=234ceeed1df9aa80a77304c857deb252 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d35fe725/uploads/origins/4ac48351-f7ba-4f9d-9dc3-32df27c55a3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf1a8fdf20cc6c8b8a8987ddfe0ef794", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d35fe725/uploads/origins/4ac48351-f7ba-4f