ng but deep down he loves Red Hair enough to sacrifice his own life for him.\n\nThe scene starts with Fox Ears giving Red Hair a peck on the cheek. Red Hair deeply blushed while Fox Ears smirked only to be surprised when Red Hair kissed Fox Ears on the mouth in retaliation. The kiss grew deeper and Red Hair ended up carrying Fox Ears to their bed where they have passionate sex (missionary position, Red Hair kisses Fox Ears deeply as if he can't get enough his taste and arms wrapped around him possesively, Fox Ears also has his arms around Red Hair but less tightly) and Red Hair came inside Fox Ears.\n\nEnds with a cuddle scene as they both went to sleep\n\nPlease resend if amount is not enough\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hCFcS8HMwXMzE0JyKrTK0D9Jb6tLXqhG", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@jo_oekaki_/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2168867, "client_id": 1299722, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/438f77c4/uploads/origins/8d186c5b-569e-4ef4-a131-463ad4ab883e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20de189181f31331a1a8c6a61b34946d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/438f77c4/uploads/origins/8d186c5b-569e-4ef4-a131-463ad4ab883e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20de189181f31331a1a8c6a61b34946d, https://si.imgix.net/438f77c4/uploads/origins/8d186c5b-569e-4ef4-a131-463ad4ab883e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=110c43c545c86c399f44968e0f9d7091 2x, https://si.imgix.net/438f77c4/uploads/origins/8d186c5b-569e-4ef4-a131-463ad4ab883e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f39857d3af0e967ef02c5871c936a546 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/438